{title: Izhar's Line}
{subtitle: Exodus 6:18; 6:21; Numbers 3:19–27; 1 Chronicles 26:23–29; Numbers 16:1–32; 1 Chronicles 6:2–38}
{key: Dm}
{tempo: 71}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Dm] | [C] | [Bb] | [Dm] [C] |
